    {
      "name": "Spider Swarm Venom",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 14 Fortitude save</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> 1 poison and Enfeebled 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> poison and enfeebled 1 (1 round)</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Swarming Bites",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Each enemy in the spider swarm's space takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> piercing damage with a DC 14 basic Reflex save.</p>\n<p>A creature that fails its save is exposed to spider swarm venom.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>An abundance of food, the sudden hatching of a clutch of eggs, or magical influence can cause smaller spiders to gather in terrifying, deadly masses.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Few everyday vermin inspire as much dread as the infamous spider.</p>",
